        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8531E, Egg Knobset with Quincy Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Classic Brass Egg Knob with Quincy Rosette is beautiful, traditional knobset that is suitable for interior doors needing dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The pairing of the egg shaped knob with the Quincy rosette has long been a favorite for its old world elegance. The Egg Knobset with Quincy Rose will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional Egg Knob with Quincy Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Egg Knob with Quincy Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stem: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
